---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Scaling Your Activewear Brand: The Strategic Advantage of Sourcing Ready-to-Ship Inventory"
  description="Learn how high-volume retailers and boutique chains maximize ROI by leveraging Fitclo's premium ready-to-ship activewear collection."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Supply Chain Strategy</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Scaling Your Activewear Brand: The Strategic Advantage of <span class="text-accent italic">Ready-to-Ship Inventory</span></h2>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 19, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>8 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">For retailers aiming for $20,000 to $30,000 monthly procurement, the biggest hurdle isn't just finding a product—it's managing the cash flow gap between production and sale.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">The Cash Flow Advantage</h2>
      <p>Bespoke manufacturing often requires a 60-90 day lead time. For a $30,000 order, that's capital tied up for a quarter of the year. By utilizing Fitclo's <strong>Ready-to-Ship (RTS) program</strong>, you cut that lead time to 48 hours. This allows you to turn your inventory faster, reinvesting profits monthly rather than quarterly.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Consistency at Scale</h2>
      <p>When ordering 5,000+ pieces, consistency is king. Because our RTS inventory is produced in large, vertically integrated batches, every piece in your $20k order shares the same dye lot, hand-feel, and compression strength. This eliminates the "batch variance" often found in smaller, fragmented productions.</p>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-3xl my-12 border-l-4 border-accent">
        <h4 class="font-black text-black mb-4 uppercase">Executive Summary for High-Volume Buyers:</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>• <strong>Zero Lead Time:</strong> Ship within 48 hours of payment.</li>
          <li>• <strong>Capital Efficiency:</strong> Reinvest profits 3x faster than custom OEM.</li>
          <li>• <strong>Tested Quality:</strong> Our stock styles are our best-sellers, proven in the US/EU markets.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">How to Build Your $30k Collection</h2>
      <p>Most high-value partners start with a core collection of high-waist leggings (60% of volume) and sports bras (40% of volume). By choosing 3-4 trending colors from our warehouse, you can launch a complete brand aesthetic without the R&D risks of custom manufacturing.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Ready to scale your inventory?</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Connect with our senior consultants to discuss high-volume pricing and logistics.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Get Bulk Pricing</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
